OL,3,GNEWSALondon paramedics 'first' to use
OL,4,Aunderwater drones
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the Lee Valley White Water Centre,
OL,7,FLondon's specialist paramedics from the
OL,8,FHazardous Area Response Team are
OL,9,Ftraining with their new kit.
OL,11,FThey recently purchased three unmanned
OL,12,Funderwater vehicles - known as
OL,13,Funderwater drones - that can be used in
OL,14,Fthe search and rescue of people who
OL,15,Fhave got into difficulty in water.
OL,17,F"It's the best," said Sam Barton, from
OL,18,Fthe London Ambulance Service (LAS).
OL,19,F"[We are] the first ambulance service
OL,20,Fin the country to have this piece of
OL,21,Fkit and one of the first emergency
OL,22,Fservices as well."
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
