OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon paramedics 'first' to use
OL,4,Aunderwater drones
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe drones enter the water and use a
OL,7,Fmechanical grabber arm to rescue
OL,8,Fcasualties from dangerous water
OL,9,Fconditions. Previously, paramedics used
OL,10,Flong-armed poles to try to reach
OL,11,Fcasualties safely.
